{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026528SGg4Elj1795772900.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞太區主要股市連升第二日。</p><p></p><p>日本股市先跌後倒升，重上58,700點水平，並以接近全日高位收市。綜合全星期，日股累積升幅百分之4。</p><p></p><p>韓國股市單日升逾百分之4，全周升近百分之1。</p><p></p><p>台灣和澳洲股市走勢靠穩，全周累積升約百分之2至9。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T10:44:00.640303+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T09:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T02:17:15.732051+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T10:37:23.919576+00:00","content_hash":"cf3ace1c43129f973d5a9b856638bdbabe65c0fd0954bdd21d4cd890e8df1838","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T10:44:00.640303+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}